Vid Sintef schrieb:
> What exactly is the role or logic of colon in Lojban? Is it a genuine
> and exclusive substitution for "cusku", or can it also behave like a
> sentence separator as does in English?

there is no colon in lojban.
when you write something like:

A: coi
B: coi abu gasnu ma
A: zutse

then it's not completely lojban text - only the part after the colons
is, the part before the colon and the colon itself just tells who wrote.
